    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1728744734530\" id=\"item-670a8d1ee7db81718001c9a1\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-video video-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/website.components.video.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/34418.js&quot;,&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/website.components.video.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.video\" data-sqsp-block=\"video\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_16846\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_16846\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n  <div class=\"intrinsic\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n    <div class=\"embed-block-wrapper\">\n      <div\n        class=\"sqs-native-video\"\n        data-config-settings=\"\"\n        data-config-video=\"{&quot;systemDataSourceType&quot;:&quot;mp4&quot;,&quot;alexandriaUrl&quot;:&quot;https://video.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/0fd421d9-e79a-4030-9344-271274476b43/{variant}&quot;,&quot;durationSeconds&quot;:109.317542,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:1.7777777777777777,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;670c998be7db8171806a1c52&quot;,&quot;systemDataVariants&quot;:&quot;1920:1080,640:360&quot;,&quot;alexandriaLibraryId&quot;:&quot;66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32&quot;,&quot;audioCodec&quot;:&quot;aac&quot;,&quot;systemDataId&quot;:&quot;0fd421d9-e79a-4030-9344-271274476b43&quot;,&quot;videoCodec&quot;:&quot;h264&quot;}\"\n        data-config-loading=\"\"\n        \n      >\n        <div\n          class=\"native-video-player\"\n          style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9;\"\n        >\n          \n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n\n\n\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n  \n  \n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_16846 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_16846 .intrinsic {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_16846 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-video-block-blend);\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-video-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_16846 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_16846 .intrinsic {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n  <style>#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_16846 { border-width: 0; height: auto; }</style>\n  \n  \n  \n    <style>\n    \n      \n    \n      \n        @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_16846 { background-color: transparent; }\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_16846 .intrinsic { background-color: var(--tweak-video-block-background-color); }\n        }\n      \n    \n    </style>\n  \n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-57e94ded1c1ee1fede48\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Property Media Japan specialises in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floor-plans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Located at 11 Inverness Crescent, this charming single-level residence presents an appealing opportunity for families or investors alike. Nestled in the tranquil neighborhood of Arrowtown, the property boasts a serene setting with lush surroundings and picturesque mountain views, ensuring a perfect blend of comfort and nature.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Property Highlights:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Build Date &amp; Structure</strong>: This well-maintained home reflects a robust construction and thoughtful layout designed to accommodate modern living.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Floor and Land Size</strong>: The property sits on a generous plot, providing ample outdoor space for gardening and leisure activities. The interior spans a practical floor plan that maximizes the use of space.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Living Spaces</strong>: Featuring three cozy bedrooms and a single bathroom, the home is ideal for small to medium-sized families. The spacious living room serves as the heart of the home, offering a warm and inviting atmosphere with plenty of natural light.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Kitchen and Dining</strong>: The kitchen is equipped with modern appliances and ample storage, making it perfect for culinary enthusiasts. Adjacent to the kitchen, the dining area provides a comfortable space for family meals and gatherings.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Appeal</strong>: The home includes a private garage and additional off-street parking, catering to multiple vehicles. The garden area is a highlight, offering privacy and a tranquil escape from the daily hustle.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Additional Features</strong>: Attention to detail is evident throughout the home, with quality fittings and fixtures ensuring both style and functionality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This property is a must-see for those who value peace and privacy while being close to all local amenities. Whether you're looking for a family home or an investment opportunity, 11 Inverness Crescent offers a unique blend of lifestyle and comfort.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspect-ratio&quot;:&quot;square&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;670c9b1b6379d14db4182068&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;lightbox&quot;:false,&quot;padding&quot;:20,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;thumbnails-per-row&quot;:4,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;670c9b1b6379d14db4182068&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_17378\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n        